Repository License And Reuse Boundary

This repository contains mixed paper, code, model, data, and documentation
materials for:

Levinson, David M., and Yuanlin Huang. (1997). "Windowed Transportation
Planning Model." Transportation Research Record 1607:45-54.
https://doi.org/10.3141/1607-07

