## Materials Not Relicensed

The following materials retain their original terms or are provided for
citation/provenance only:

- Publication PDFs in `paper/`.
- M-NCPPC source archive files and public-agency model materials.
- Travel/2, EMME/2, and other vendor/runtime or legacy model-system assets.
- North Bethesda SLATE model setup, land-use/network inputs, traffic counts,
  model outputs, decoded model-output sidecars, and encoded originals.
- Scanned SLATE reports and third-party/public-agency/source materials.
- Any other files whose authorship or release rights are not controlled by the
  paper/project authors or repository maintainers.

Use the repository documentation and manifests to determine the provenance of
individual files before reuse.
